# Project hint: OEM speed pipeline

- Vehicle.Speed on this project maps via vendor/oem/vss/mapping/speed.yaml, not the
  AOSP default. Check that file first for any speed-related signal bug.
- The OEM cluster app is com.oem.car.cluster; NPEs there are usually null areaId
  on single-display variants.
- After suspend/resume, CarPropertyService listeners are re-registered in
  OemPowerPolicyHandler — a common miss for "value frozen after ignition" bugs.
